                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_0",
                  "html": "<h1>Cookies Policy</h1> <p>Our website uses cookies.</p> <p>Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer or device when you visit our website</p>  <p>We’ve listed the cookies we use below with details about the type of cookie they are, why we use them, and if applicable how long they last.</p>  <p>Our website uses both session cookies and persistent cookies.</p> <p><strong>Session cookies</strong> enable any information you have entered to be remembered when you move from page to page within our website, but are deleted when you close your browser or after a short time.</p> <p><strong>Persistent cookies</strong> allow our website to remember your preferences and settings when you visit our website in the future; they expire after a set period of time.</p>  <p>Our site uses first party cookies (i.e. they are set by our website) and third party cookies (i.e. they are set by one of our service providers).</p>  <p>We do not share any information that can be used to identify you personally with these third parties.</p>",
